      "definition": "CPU time in SongCard aboutToAppear per row appearance from JS sampling stacks (getArtists frames), aggregated over the scroll.",
      "comparison": "unfixed shows repeated string-concat allocations in getArtists for every row build; fixed shows a single join per row. Aggregate scroll CPU lower in fixed; effect scales with rows rendered."
